CHAPTER.VERS:
Thus saith God the King of Israel, and the God of hosts that delivered him; 

          Re 1:17
         I am the first, and I am hereafter: beside me there is no God.

Who else will frustrate the tokens of
Gr. ventriloquists those that have divining spirits, and prophecies
See Hebrew from the heart of man? turning the wise back, and making their counsel foolishness;
